Patch scripts for NVIDIA's "RTX Remix for Minecraft" (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/NVIDIAGameWorks/rtx-remix-minecraft).
This repository is not affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA, Mojang or Microsoft. It contains no NVIDIA binaries, shaders or
game assets. GlassContactFaces.java and HookEmitter.java are written to be applied to that mod's BlockQuadEmitter class and are
offered under the same Apache-2.0 licence so they can be contributed upstream.
